
# Obtain A Stew Pot

>  Clay Cistern

---
To begin with, you'll need a &bClay Pot&r, which you'll need to &6fire in a furnace&r. A &bStew Pot&r is used to make &aSoups, Stews, and Aspics&r.

Once placed, you can &afill the Stew Pot&r by &6right clicking it&r with a &bBucket of Milk or Water&r, or &bBowls&r of whichever ingredient.
            